hought about Lil' Rock and then zapped out\n[01:06.18] Billion dollar schemes all mapped out\n[01:07.88] Six 'Lac trucks all blacked-out\n[01:09.38] We in it to win, we spinning the Ben'\n[01:11.10] My nigga, this ain't nothing to act 'bout\n[01:12.68] Jumped in, I couldn't swim, but I grew a fin\n[01:14.44] Now I rip a fuck nigga back out\n[01:16.08] I'm sober again, but give Juice a ten\n[01:17.68] And he probably bring you some Act' out (Ayy, ayy)\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & G Herbo]\n[01:20.66] Umm, ride around with that Nina, like, cash out (Yeah)\n[01:22.96] And on my wrist is a glasshouse (Yeah)\n[01:24.50] Smoking Posto 'til I pass out (Yeah)\n[01:26.22] Told Swerve that we gotta blackout (Yeah)\n[01:28.12] So, bitch, I'ma black out (Yeah)\n[01:30.16] Ayy, Herb, should I get that new Ferrari or not?\n[01:31.48] Yeah, go ahead, crash-out (Skrrt)\n[01:32.66] They mad, we all the way turnt up (Why?)\n[01:34.28] Like fuck is you Roscoe Dash now?\n[01:36.02] And the label is mad we taking the money from them\n[01:38.10] Fuck is you Dame Dash now? (Prolly)\n[01:39.54] I don't even got my license, but fuck it, I'm doing the dash now (Skrrt, yeah)\n[01:42.94] I'm busy recording, but my shorty horny, I walk in the room and her ass out (Come here)\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:46.50] Smoking on KD pack (Dope)\n[01:47.72] Like a sick dog, they put his ass down (Bitch)\n[01:49.34] But them niggas is pussies, they cats now (Pussies)\n[01:51.06] They get beat like a thief if they act out (Yeah)\n[01:52.66] Turn the studio into a crack house (Yeah)\n[01:54.32] The computer's the kitchen, the mic is a dish and the coke gettin' cut in the background (Yeah)\n[01:57.76] I feel like I'm El Chapo when it come to music, I got me a couple of plaques now (Yeah)\n[02:01.22] Comin' out the MAC, it's a gun sound, hey\n[02:02.66] It's sittin' on my wrist, it's a bust-down, hey\n[02:04.56] Put 30 in the clip, take a opp to the face\n[02:06.00] Put that price on your head, they'll be coming your way\n[02:07.62] While they hunting you down, me and bae on a date, ayy\n[02:10.04] I got the shrooms with the steak\n[02:10.98] Pockets just like my belly, I already ate, ayy\n[02:13.32] Talkin' tough ain't okay, sealed your fate, make a nigga relocate, ayy\n[02:16.58] I put the .45 to his face, need everything, he said A-OK, ayy\n[02:20.00] Niggas get scared when you up them sticks\n[02:21.50] Used to hit stains, get Schwifty like Rick\n[02:23.34] Yeah, I'm with the love of my life right now\n[02:24.76] Back in the day, probably bust on your bitch\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & G Herbo]\n[02:27.32] Umm, ride around with that Nina, like, cash out (Yeah)\n[02:29.66] And on my wrist is a glasshouse (Yeah)\n[02:31.16] Smoking Posto 'til I pass out (Yeah)\n[02:32.88] Told Swerve that we gotta blackout (Yeah)\n[02:34.78] So, bitch, I'ma black out (Yeah)\n[02:36.06] Ayy, Herb, should I get that new Ferrari or not?\n[02:38.14] Yeah, go ahead, crash-out (Skrrt)\n[02:39.56] They mad, we all the way turnt up (Why?)\n[02:40.98] Like fuck is you Roscoe Dash now?\n[02:42.68] And the label is mad we taking the money from them\n[02:44.76] Fuck is you Dame Dash now? (Prolly)\n[02:46.20] I don't even got my license, but fuck it, I'm doing the dash now (Skrrt, yeah)\n[02:49.62] I'm busy recording, but my shorty horny, I walk in the room and her ass out (Come here)","words":[[0.02,0.1,"[Intro:"],[0.14,0.22,"Juice"],[0.26,0.32,"WRLD"],[0.34,0.36,"&"],[0.4,0.4,"G"],[0.44,0.52,"Herbo]"],[0.54,0.56,"[00:00.58]"],[0.6,0.84,"Start"],[0.88,1.1,"over"],[1.14,1.22,"folk"],[1.26,1.38,"(What?)"],[1.4,1.42,"[00:01.52]"],[1.46,1.46,"I"],[1.54,1.62,"was"],[1.66,1.8,"finna"],[1.84,1.96,"just"],[2.0,2.1,"get"],[2.16,2.26,"up"],[2.32,2.42,"out"],[2.46,2.48,"of"],[2.52,2.58,"here"],[2.62,2.68,"on"],[2.76,2.88,"folks"],[2.92,3.02,"(But—,"],[3.06,3.14,"right)"],[3.16,3.18,"[00:03.22]"],[3.22,3.32,"Hold"],[3.36,3.38,"on,"],[3.48,3.48,"I"],[3.68,3.84,"had"],[3.88,3.9,"to"],[3.94,4.02,"tweak,"],[4.06,4.08,"we"],[